# The image needs the full source (bun install + the workspace builds
# run inside it): only VCS metadata, dependency caches and build
# artifacts are excluded. (The workspaces field lists apps/*,
# packages/*, packages/plugins/*, integration-tests and e2e-tests —
# their package.json files must stay.)
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.medusa
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
